 "notes": [
  "Starting (6) as posted: Ice Plains (starting location; no objective), Prepared Defenses, You May Start Your Landing, IAO & Secret Plans, No Escape (usually), Fear Is My Ally; all count toward the 60. The strategy says No Escape may be swapped for Imperial Decree or Prepare For A Surface Attack.",
  "Posted 'No Escape (usually)' dested the Jabba's Palace Sealed Deck effect No Escape (a starting effect inside the 60, as in his January 2002 list); 'IAO & Secret Plans' dested the combo Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans.",
  "Posted 'Executor DB' dested Executor: Docking Bay; 'DII DB' Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'H DB' Hoth: Echo Docking Bay (Dark); 'H 3rd/4th/6th marker' the Dark Hoth Defensive Perimeter, North Ridge and Mountains marker sites; 'Hoth' the Dark Hoth system.",
  "Posted 'Darth Maul' kept as the Tatooine-set Darth Maul; 'Darth Vader w/ saber' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Chimera' dested Chimaera; 'Bossk in HT'/'Zuckuss in MH' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth and Zuckuss In Mist Hunter.",
  "Posted under 'OTHER STUFF (2)': 'Battle DEployment (Ad Order)' dested the Admiral's Order Battle Deployment; 'Maul's double bladed lightsaber (weapon)' dested Maul's Double-Bladed Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'Twilek' dested Twi'lek Advisor; 'Unsalvegavble' dested Unsalvageable; 'SHUO Shut him down' dested Shut Him Up Or Shut Him Down; 'Drop' dested Drop!.",
